<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41660" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχράω</span></b>  (B), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χράω</span> B), poet. word, only aor. 2 or impf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέχρᾰον,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>attack, assault,</i> c. dat.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς δὲ λύκοι ἄρνεσσιν ἐπέχραον..ὣς
				Δαναοὶ Τρώεσσιν ἐπέχραον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.352
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				356
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητέρι μοι μνηστῆρες ἐπέχραον</span>
			<i>beset</i> her, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>to
				be violent, rage,</i> of the winds, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.498
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c.
			inf., <i>to be urgent</i> or <i>eager</i> to do,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.508
			</span></i> : c. acc. et inf., [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγκη</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">με..νεῖσθαι
				ἐπέχραε</span>
			<i>was urgent</i> that I should come, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.431
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
